on regimen. Follow-up imaging and lab work are scheduled to ensure her continued recovery.\n\n---\n\n**February 15, 2023**\n\nMs. Ruiz was today for follow-up regarding her breast cancer, stage 0, which was treated approximately 0.1 years ago. Her blood pressure was 133/68, and she weighed 154 pounds. She is currently on tamoxifen 20 mg daily. She reports feeling well overall, with no significant symptoms. The physical examination was largely normal, and we discussed the importance of maintaining her regular follow-ups. She has been advised to monitor for any new symptoms or changes.\n\n---\n\n**Social History:**\n\nMs. Ruiz has a"
